+      <div class="eyebrow">Cat care basics</div>
+      <h1 id="page-title">FAQ for curious cat people</h1>
+      <p class="intro">Quick answers to common questions about happy, healthy indoor cats. Select a question to expand the answer.</p>
+    </section>
+
+    <section class="faq-card" aria-label="Frequently asked questions about cats">
+      <div class="example">
+        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="answer-1" id="question-1">
+          Why do cats purr?
+          <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
+        </button>
+        <div class="details" id="answer-1" role="region" aria-labelledby="question-1" hidden>
+          <p>Cats often purr when they feel relaxed or content, but purring can also happen when they are seeking comfort, recovering, or communicating with people and other cats.</p>
